CAT Align

The inference encoder in src/cat_align/models/conformer.py adapts Conformer and
VGG2L components from CAT and CTC-TTS. The adaptation keeps the checkpoint
parameter names and both published Whistle attention implementations while
removing unrelated architectures and training dependencies.

